es that she has very bad luck, but manages to deal with it. She was supposed to work as a servant in his household when her people sent her as a 'gift' to Arawn after hearing of his resurrection."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c12931"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/71/71a7c20d21494cb20e9df71b7201bd71ffee7a7ee60a518820cc464b2183ab22.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e5/e5644a3dc4bea550f844e9f1e706f2b70bd06730c3efc62e1de1e12d7b19dc84.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"名塚 佳織","creatorId":"vndb:s2232","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2232","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2232","name":"名塚佳織","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:40149","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c12932","characterName":"ラスティ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c12932"},"originalCharacterName":"ラスティ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Rathty is a Mining Elf who is good at making weapons and hardware. Arawn’s first impression of Rathty is that she is a boy. She tried to hide her gender as a female in order to stay with the party. Although Rathty is a weapons dealer she secretly wishes to sell household appliances."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c12932"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c4/c4cf8e23a5286fb1de3ecaa4b8acb7c0d99e4f54d281a2f68a5a21917a5586b5.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b0/b0ebf92cf0fc6be4ef603e7c23a56122164750a3a054baae9a642b078414e1e2.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"植田 佳奈","creatorId":"vndb:s17","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s17","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s17","name":"植田 佳奈","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:40136","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c12933","characterName":"タリエシン","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c12933"},"originalCharacterName":"タリエシン","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Taliesin is a Wandering Bard or better known as a Minstrel. Although he refuses to acknowledge it he is informally the leader of Brigantes tribe. Taliesin considers himself to be a free spirit and a observer of beauty/a flirt."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c12933"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/90/9058a3e829037b0c1c9e015299c01b865dfb352681d8682b50a103253d4a7111.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/79/79223b6c84fd3e57b235f7a44b983ec7f4154c13a3b98cb8b8e499951d618919.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"坪井 智浩","creatorId":"vndb:s254","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s254","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s254","name":"坪井 智浩","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:40138","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c12934","characterName":"ガイウス","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c12934"},"originalCharacterName":"ガイウス","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The Commanding General of the Divine Empire's army. Considered by most to be a military genius Gaius is determined to rise through the ranks until he can become king of the holy roman empire. While General Gaius does not agree with all of the polices of the holy roman empire, and even sympathizes with the Gail tribe, he is determined in his duty."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c12934"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/87/871fa2a9fb7b85c691dfdd9e27d74bef9281ec34d54c3fe5f7863c1424be9ddb.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/75/7553f3245c77aeb8648da7538f5b8c36e9476e2fa8b09f1c3db9f5bfcf49b30b.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"浜田 賢二","creatorId":"vndb:s385","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s385","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s385","name":"浜田 賢二","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:40139","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c38942","characterName":"リディア","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c38942"},"originalCharacterName":"リディア","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Lydia is the new character that appeared in the PlayStation 3 remake, Tears to Tiara: Kakan no Daichi."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"In the anime she is first seen in episode 7, leading a group of"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"soldiers wearing seemingly red colored metal as armor."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is the Commander of Ruburumu."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Tears to Tiara Wiki"},{"spoiler":true,"text":"When Octavia defeated her in a duel shown in the flashback, she said that she could go crazy and kill or hurt anything in front of her when the sole thought of the incident and the shame has inflicted her. She commented that she would die of her insanity if she were not made Commander of Ruburumu."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"She later faces off against Octavia one last time in Episode 11 of the anime. Throughout the fight, flashbacks show that Octavia and Lydia were once the best of friends during their Imperial Training (before the fateful fight in which Octavia didn't kill her). The duel ends with Lydia's death. Her final words to Octavia are asking if she was a good swordsman."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Along with Gaius, Lidia is a playable unit in the fandisc."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c38942"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fe/fe6f2932fac5001ea06d106f298a410e209591e9b93b00efb2bdaa54638026e1.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/af/af8314a7acf2d4c0c38634e231644124921897fb3d932a640b8324822643f375.webp","width":178,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"沢城 みゆき","creatorId":"vndb:s43","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s43","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s43","name":"沢城 みゆき","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:40137","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c8775","characterName":"アロウン","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c8775"},"originalCharacterName":"アロウン","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The Great Demon King, he was sealed away for 1000 years after his mortal body dies on the battlefield. Drwc resurrected him using Riannon as living sacrifice, but is instead killed after Arawn saves Riannon from mind control. She takes a liking to him instantly, and makes him chieftain of the Gael Tribe."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Arawn's true name, a name that awakens his power is Lucifer. He was the 13th Angel born after the previous 12 and was thought to be an imperfection. He became one of the 12 Angels after his \"father\" Angel, Myrddin died by performing the Song of Creation. He assumed role of his \"father\", opposed the remaining 11 White Angels, thus leading him to be exiled from Heaven, and became a Fallen Angel."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c8775"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/61/61dd941ef41e42a6094b9c6de816f8f4685446479b47358d7563d88c5e295740.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5a/5a2d44cce81fa834e179c490ec28e87502bee977464a3850d121a88e48abbd60.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"大川 透","creatorId":"vndb:s551","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s551","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s551","name":"大川 透","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:40142","source":"vndb"}]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"egs:brand:644","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:644","canonicalEntityId":"egs:brand:644","name":"AQUAPLUS","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-brand:14476:644","source":"egs"},{"companyId":"vndb:p87","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p87","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p87","name":"AQUAPLUS","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:127746:v7533","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p87","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p87","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p87","name":"AQUAPLUS","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:rel